#{[17592186442114 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186442113 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442114 #edb/ref 1069 "q-170503" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442114 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442114 #edb/ref 1071 "The minimum value of the quadratic form $Q(x)={x}_{1}^{2}-9{x}_{2}^{2}-{x}_{3}^{2}-6{x}_{2}{x}_{3},$ when $‖x‖=1,$ is equal to $-10.$ Which of the following is a vector $x$ at which the minimum is attained?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442114 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "95026062-b044-5134-829b-f9813c55ce41" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442114 #edb/ref 1074 "Let $A$ be the matrix corresponding to our quadratic form. Recall that: \n\n- The maximum value of $Q(x),$ when $‖x‖=1,$ is equal to the largest eigenvalue of $A:$\n\n$$\nmax\\{Q(x)\\,|\\,‖x‖=1\\}={\\lambda }_{\\text{max}}\n$$\n\n \nThe maximum is attained on the corresponding unit eigenvector ${u}_{\\text{max}}.$\n\n- The minimum value of $Q(x),$ when $‖x‖=1,$ is equal to the smallest eigenvalue of $A:$\n\n$$\nmin\\{Q(x)\\,|\\,‖x‖=1\\}={\\lambda }_{\\text{min}}\n$$\n\n \nThe minimum is attained on the corresponding unit eigenvector ${u}_{\\text{min}}.$\n\nFirst, we write down the matrix of our quadratic form:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -9 & -3 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNow, we need the unit eigenvector that corresponds to the eigenvalue ${\\lambda }_{\\text{min}}=-10:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(-10)I & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -9 & -3 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -1\\end{aligned}]+10[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}11 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 9\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(A-(-10)I)x=0$ gives the eigenvector $v=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$ \n\nFinally, dividing $v$ by its norm $‖v‖=\\sqrt{10},$ we get \n\n$$\n{u}_{\\text{min}}=\\frac{v}{‖v‖}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442115 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186442116 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442115 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "196c1ec1-7222-5bfa-b1e9-032cecfa7659" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442115 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186388524 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442116 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186442118 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442116 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "3bf30ed1-f62d-5db0-95c3-bae2ee7a2121" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442116 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186378955 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442117 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186442119 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442117 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "5f8ca3b8-f2b1-5dda-8678-447d69f170dd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442117 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186410195 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442118 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186442117 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442118 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "92250051-c04a-54d1-8629-4491dfcb275a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442118 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186442114 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442119 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "e31c99b8-71b1-5ecf-a2b4-f70c0a3c9f33" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186442119 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186378969 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492271 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492271 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492271 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1c4c2ff5-edba-514a-87a6-58daf1e367d1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492276 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492276 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492276 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1d9e2ab8-f0d5-5abe-b74e-db6a46609bb7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492282 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186492282 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/